---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { repository, library } from '../lib/library';
const articles = await library();
---
<Base title="About the library" active="about"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A living reference</p><h1>Clarity over hype.</h1><p>Agentic Bible is a growing encyclopedia of AI agents and the technology around them. The goal is useful context, with a visible trail back to the evidence.</p></header><div class="about-grid"><section class="prose" id="editorial"><h2>Start with the source</h2><p>Entries connect explanations to primary documentation and research. We distinguish documented behavior, illustrative examples, and project proposals. Protocol and API details change; version context and source-check dates help you judge what still applies.</p><h2>A small, honest beginning</h2><p>This preview contains {articles.length} AI-assisted working drafts. Sources have been consulted, but independent editorial review is pending. File history is available on GitHub. These entries are not a complete survey of the field.</p><h2>Living does not mean unchecked</h2><p>The founder approved automatic article publication, with flags for human admin review after publication. Source evidence, technical validation, cost limits and reversible history remain required. This version provides reading, topic navigation, and local search. Automated maintenance, article publication, and public submissions are not enabled. A separate local synthetic preview exercises correction submissions and an editorial inbox; production admin identity and secure integration settings remain unfinished.</p><h2>Contributions will come later</h2><p>Public submissions are on hold while code and content licensing, contributor terms, privacy rules, and moderation are resolved. Please do not submit third-party text, code, or datasets yet.</p><a class="text-link" href={`${repository}/blob/${'feat/reference-library-slice'}/GOVERNANCE.md`}>Read the governance proposal <svg class="icon-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></a></section><aside class="about-note"><p class="eyebrow">This edition</p><dl><div><dt>Collection</dt><dd>{articles.length} working drafts</dd></div><div><dt>Sources</dt><dd>Primary documentation & research</dd></div><div><dt>Search</dt><dd>Local, in your browser</dd></div><div><dt>Analytics & advertising</dt><dd>Disabled</dd></div></dl><p>No accounts, tracking scripts, or AI requests are needed to read or search. Search terms stay in the browser’s URL fragment; this app does not send them to a search service.</p></aside></div></Base>
